\item{\code{residue_map}}{object; \code{NA} when \code{--no-residue-map} was given. \{row_count, column_names, columns\}: one row per residue of each sequence of each pair, pair by pair, each pair's source residues (positions 1 to its length) and then its target residues (typed under result.tables.residue_map).}
